{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-06-22 14:43:00', 'title': 'OMNICOM GROUP PUBLISHES INAUGURAL DE&I REPORT', 'text': 'AFFIRMS RELENTLESS COMMITMENT TO EQUITY FOR ALL NEW YORK , JUNE 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- OMNICOM GROUP (NYSE: OMC) RELEASED ITS FIRST STAND-ALONE DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION (DE&I) REPORT. THE REPORT, "RESPONSIBLY RELENTLESS: EQUITY FOR ALL," OUTLINES THE COMPANY\'S KEY AREAS OF FOCUS FOR DE&I AND INCLUDES 2021 U.S. DIVERSITY METRICS, KEY PERFORMANCE INDICATORS (KPIS) AND OUR\xa0STRATEGIC FRAMEWORK TO ENSURE DE&I PERMEATES ALL BUSINESS OPERATIONS, EMPLOYEE AND CLIENT EXPERIENCES, AND PARTNERSHIPS.'}